    "result_text": "The full suite is green \u2014 32 tests run, 0 failures, 0 errors.\n\n## Summary\n\nI implemented the audit requirement in `OwnerRestControllerV1.addOwner`:\n\n1. **Added a dedicated `AUDIT` logger** (`OwnerRestControllerV1.java:64`) via `LoggerFactory.getLogger(\"AUDIT\")` \u2014 matching the logger name the `AuditLogCapture` test harness attaches its appender to.\n\n2. **Emitted the audit line on successful create** (right after `saveOwner`, once the owner has its generated id, assigned `customerCode`, and adjusted `registrationDate`):\n   ```java\n   AUDIT.info(\"owner created id={} customerCode={} registrationDate={}\",\n       owner.getId(), owner.getCustomerCode(), owner.getRegistrationDate());\n   ```\n\nThe line is emitted only after a successful save, so it isn't logged when a create is rejected by one of the earlier validation guards. `Cp21Tests` and all 32 tests pass.",
